[Poke:Infinite Lives]
<div>
  <code>POKE #R$A9AC(#N$A9AC),#N$00</code>
</div>
<div>
  <code>POKE #R$B6C9(#N$B6C9),#N$00</code>
</div>

Removes the two instructions which would otherwise decrease #R$968B.

<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$A9A9(#N$A9A9)</td>
      <td class="instruction">LD #REGhl,#R$968B(#N$968B)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$A9AC(#N$A9AC)</td>
      <td class="instruction">DEC (#REGhl)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$A9AD(#N$A9AD)</td>
      <td class="instruction">XOR #REGa</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$B6C6(#N$B6C6)</td>
      <td class="instruction">LD #REGhl,#R$968B(#N$968B)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$B6C9(#N$B6C9)</td>
      <td class="instruction">DEC (#REGhl)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$B6CA(#N$B6CA)</td>
      <td class="instruction">CALL #R$A091(#N$A091)</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

To:

<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$A9A9(#N$A9A9)</td>
      <td class="instruction">LD #REGhl,#R$968B(#N$968B)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$A9AC(#N$A9AC)</td>
      <td class="instruction">NOP</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$A9AD(#N$A9AD)</td>
      <td class="instruction">XOR #REGa</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$B6C6(#N$B6C6)</td>
      <td class="instruction">LD #REGhl,#R$968B(#N$968B)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$B6C9(#N$B6C9)</td>
      <td class="instruction">NOP</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$B6CA(#N$B6CA)</td>
      <td class="instruction">CALL #R$A091(#N$A091)</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

[Poke:Infinite Energy]
<div>
  <code>POKE #R$A6C3(#N$A6C3),#N$00</code>
</div>
<div>
  <code>POKE #N($A6C4),#N$00</code>
</div>

Removes the instruction which would otherwise take the energy that is used
away from #R$963A.

<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$A6C2(#N$A6C2)</td>
      <td class="instruction">AND #REGa</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$A6C3(#N$A6C3)</td>
      <td class="instruction">SBC #REGhl,#REGde</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$A6C5(#N$A6C5)</td>
      <td class="instruction">JR C,#R$A6CB(#N$A6CB)</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

To:

<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$A6C2(#N$A6C2)</td>
      <td class="instruction">AND #REGa</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$A6C3(#N$A6C3)</td>
      <td class="instruction">NOP</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#N$A6C4</td>
      <td class="instruction">NOP</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$A6C5(#N$A6C5)</td>
      <td class="instruction">JR C,#R$A6CB(#N$A6CB)</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
